      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 19 years 6 months ago",
      "body": "Just wanted to give some praise to the staff at Portmeirion in North Wales.\nWe visited last week with our 5 month old LO whilst on holiday and the staff were great, they let us know where all the baby changing rooms were (without us asking) and were generally very baby/pushchair friendly.\nIt might not be everyones cup of tea, but we had a lovely relaxing day out there!\nxxx",
